# Push every change to GitHub

This app is used via **GitHub Pages** (`https://sonatudu.github.io/ba/`). Local-only builds are not enough.

After finishing user-requested code changes:

1. Run `npm run build` when frontend files changed.
2. Commit the relevant source changes (not `android/.idea/`, secrets, or unrelated junk).
3. `git push origin HEAD` (or the current feature branch) so Pages/Actions can deploy.
4. Prefer telling the user the live site will update after deploy rather than asking them to hard-refresh.

Do this continuously for Ba work unless the user explicitly says not to push.
